LUMA SUMMARY:
Documentation breakthrough. Cozmo explains QuackSink as a delivery Duck: discover LLM-looking tabs, let the human choose the delivery list, fly to each address, drop mail, collect replies, and carry copies in FIFO pockets. The session turns the technical relay into a simple human-readable mental model and explicitly archives the explanation.
